# Accessibility audit: Switch (2026-11-15)

Scope: `spec/components/switch/contract.json`, `src/components/switch/*`, `playwright/tests/switch/*`. Standard: WCAG 2.2 AA and the WAI-ARIA APG switch pattern (native checkbox with `role="switch"`; Space toggles; Enter submits the form per the contract).

## Criteria

| POUR | Criterion | Result | Evidence |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| P | 1.4.11 track and border contrast, light | Pass | Probe: unchecked track/border `rgb(115,115,115)` on `rgb(255,255,255)` 4.74:1, thumb on track 4.74:1; checked track `rgb(135,79,27)` 6.64:1, thumb on track 6.64:1 |
| P | 1.4.11 track and border contrast, dark (`&globals=theme:dark`) | Pass | Page `rgb(10,10,10)`: unchecked track 4.18:1, thumb on track 4.18:1; checked track `rgb(202,148,105)` 7.50:1, thumb on track 7.50:1 |
| P | 1.4.1 state not by color alone | Pass | Thumb moves to the other end when on; the AX tree exposes `checked` |
| P | 2.4.7 / 1.4.11 focus ring | Pass | Keyboard focus: `:focus-visible` matches, 3px ring in `rgb(115,115,115)` (4.74:1 light); contract pair `switch.focus-ring.color` passes T6 |
| P | prefers-reduced-motion | Pass | `reduced-motion: reduce`: thumb and track `transition-duration` computes to `0s` (0.15s otherwise); `Switch.scss:61` and `:99` include `respect-reduced-motion` |
